WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.800
[Scene] Hand-drawn birthday cake invitation in warm afternoon light.

00:00:02.900 --> 00:00:06.600
Thirty copies. One under every door.

00:00:06.800 --> 00:00:14.700
[Scene] Preparing red balloons, hanging the banner, and setting an empty party table.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:18.200
It's not about you. I promise.

00:00:18.400 --> 00:00:21.200
[Scene] Waiting quietly as the room settles into late afternoon shadow.

00:00:21.500 --> 00:00:24.300
Go on. Make a wish.
